adr: 0311
file: lsp/pasls.pas
kills: lsp-server
why: The call guarded away, so a document carrying a `.importpath` sidecar reaches the compiler without the directories it names and every imported name is undeclared. It is the state the server was in before this record: a wall of diagnostics about names that are there, on seven of the twelve programs in `examples/`. The `import_path` session is the only one that can see it -- every other session names its components.
--- old
  if ReadImportPaths(base + '.importpath', paths) then
--- new
  if false and ReadImportPaths(base + '.importpath', paths) then
